This is the most amazing game I have ever played. In all honesty I think they could have put this game at 60 dollars and it would have delivered.
Beautiful soundtrack, amazing gameplay, very quick combat system, and a very interesting story at some points. I myself was on the edge at first as well but to everyone else who is even considering the game;
Get it.

When a friend told me about this game, I though it was just another CoD. One day, I wanted to play DayZ so badly that I bought the game. But, after playing DayZ I tried this game. It was so realistic and fun, I could not stop playing. So, here is my review:
Pros:
Good graphics;
Realistic and imersive gameplay;
Amazing mission editor;
Hundreds of units (including PLAYABLE ANIMALS) and weapons;
Hardcore, strategy game;
Cons:
No ragdolls.
So, this game is amazing and it is TOTALLY worth buying, not for DayZ, but for ArmA II: Operation Arrowhead.

